      "old": "Three pegs. Pulled tonight — the sand on their points is still damp.",
      "new": "Three uprooted pegs. Damp sand still clings to their points."
    },
    {
      "n": "c5_dunes",
      "p": [
        13,
        "explore",
        "spots",
        1,
        "again"
      ],
      "i": 0,
      "to": [
